# The app has no build step and no dependencies - the data scripts use only the
# Node standard library. node_modules/ is listed for the day someone reaches for
# a package anyway; nothing here should ever need one.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# OS droppings
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor cruft
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# NOT ignored, on purpose: data/*-raw.json
#
# elfeth-2026-raw.json and mawaqit-2026-raw.json are the audit trail. They are
# exactly what the mosque's feed and Mawaqit returned on the day times.json was
# generated, so a disputed minute can always be traced back to its source -
# including after the websites themselves have changed or gone away. The
# refresh workflow commits the updated snapshot together with the times it
# produced, for the same reason. Do not add them here to "clean up".
